flowchart TD
    A[Timer tick] --> B{RT task exists}
    B -->|Yes| C[Run highest RT priority]
    B -->|No| D{Local worker has task}
    D -->|Yes| E[Worker pop LIFO]
    D -->|No| F{Can steal from other CPU}
    F -->|Yes| G[Steal from top FIFO]
    F -->|No| H[Run idle loop]
    C --> I[Context switch]
    E --> I
    G --> I
    H --> I
